# Cosmology Modules — CDDR & SMBH

**CDDR (Etherington distance duality)**  
η(z) = D_L / [(1+z)² D_A] using Pantheon+, SH0ES, DESI BAO (with Lyα caution).  
**Result (conservative)**: best-fit η ≈ **0.95–0.98**.

**SMBH high-z feasibility**  
Feasibility surface over (ε, λ_Edd, duty) under ΛCDM vs Logosfield t(z).  
**Result**: all seed scenarios feasible under Logosfield timing (strict ΛCDM tighter).

**Reproduce**  
`python run.py --cosmo cddr`   or   `python run.py --cosmo smbh`  
(See Release bundles for prereg files, inputs, and expected outputs.)
